.Dd August 14, 2026
.Dt FILEES-MOBILE-V1 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm filees-mobile-v1
.Nd FileES append-only mobile protocol entry
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the set-id entry for
.Sy _filees-mobile .
The installed image is
.Sy _filees-state : _filees-access
mode 4550, the same class as
.Xr filees-client-entry 8 .
.Pp
The mobile client is paired from an already activated desktop.
It inherits that desktop's repository list once.
The protocol is append-only.
The mobile projection does not receive
.Ic editing_policy .
.Pp
.Xr sshd 8
uses the shared
.Pa authorized_keys
file.
The per-key
.Ic command=
line selects this image.
There is no
.Ic ForceCommand
on the
.Sy _filees-mobile
match block.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /var/filees-mobile/ledger
Append ledger, owner
.Sy _filees-state .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr filees-client-entry 8 ,
.Xr filees 7
